From be9380061e3ccdf1e2d015238f11798e8a024681 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 03:22:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat(gitops): show the deploy order of the picked
 databases (BYT-10423)

useDeployTargets loads the pick, expands a group to its databases, and
groups them by environment the way the rollout does. DeployOrder shows
one section per environment with three chips and "+N more", as the plan
page does, and warns about databases with no environment.
